	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Accepi tuas una cum scripto inserto, vir <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>clarissime, nihil autem, quod iis respondeam, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nunc maximopere suppetit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Similia pene <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Dietägio nostro per fratrem <persName ref="p8093">Herdlium</persName>, ducem <lb xml:id="p1z5"/><placeName ref="l648">Rhaetorum</placeName> militum perscripta fuere ex castris.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><foreign xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/><placeName ref="l513">Ulma</placeName> vero hisce diebus d. consuli <persName ref="p8055">Ambrosio</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>scriptum fuit in hanc sententiam:</foreign> Von zytung habend <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>ir zuͦvor, wie in Franckrych groß jamer ist.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="de">Man schribt <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>uns ouch uß <placeName ref="l15">Antorff</placeName> von 8. dis monats j[anuarii] <foreign xml:lang="la">per postam,</foreign> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>wie der <persName ref="p18394">printz von Uranien</persName> mitt sinem kriegsvolk <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>in <placeName ref="l832">Franckrych</placeName> sye nitt wyt von <placeName ref="l378">Parys</placeName> und alda ein stetlin <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>yngenomen mitt namen <placeName>Vytry</placeName>, alda sich als ein <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>fiend gegen dem könig erklärt und dem printz von <lb xml:id="p1z14"/><persName>Conde</persName> ein bystand ze thuͦn.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="de">So soll die <persName ref="p18465">königin uß Engelland</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ouch mitt disen beiden printzen ein verstand haben, da <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>sy hatt ettlich schiff angenomen<note type="misc">übergeschr. "coepit".</note>, so aus <placeName ref="l875">Spanya</placeName><note type="margin">a.R.: <placeName ref="l875">Spynya</placeName>.</note> per <placeName ref="l15">Antorff</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>gewelt, darinn ob 60000 ducaten; daruf der duc de <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Alba zuͦ Antorf die inglischen hatt lassen mitt lyb und <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>guͦt restyren; darf in sorgen, ein grosen krieg geben <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>werd.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l513">Ulma</placeName> etiam per monetarium quendam <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>carmina illa Teutonica et heroica allata sunt, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>quae vexillis principum inscribantur, quorum <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>animi et vires adversum Antichristum coniungi <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>dicuntur.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Multus etiam apud nos sermo est principes <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>istos arctissimo vinculo connexos Metum <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>urbem ad imperium rursus reducturos, deinde <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>sedata et compescita <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> <placeName ref="l808">Belgium</placeName>, <placeName ref="l834">Itali<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>am</placeName> adeoque ipsam quoque <placeName ref="l425">Romam</placeName>, sedem illam <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>abominandam, invisuros.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Tempus sane esset, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ut indulgentiae pontificiae semel equis et asinis <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>substernerentur, quae asinis tantum hactenus <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>imposuerunt.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Ver[end]um autem, ne semper anguis <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>in herba lateat, nisi victoria pax, non pactione pariatur.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Quae enim sit fides cardinalibus, iam tertio <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>misera <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> experta est, aut quando <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>fiet, ut <persName>Guisius</persName> cum <placeName ref="l834">Italis</placeName> suis omnibus <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>aula privetur vivente Italorum fautrice?</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Exorandus tamen dominus, ut pace certa fruamur <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>in nominis sui gloriam et suae ecclesiae glorio<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>sam libertatem.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Ocyus <placeName ref="l98">Curiae</placeName> 1569 <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>februarii 1.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z9"/>Tuae dominationi subiectissimus <lb xml:id="p2z10"/><persName ref="p8016">T<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>h[<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>obias] Eg[lius</persName>].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Am<lb xml:id="p2z13"/>plissimo viro d. m. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>ecclesiae <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> anti<lb xml:id="p2z15"/>stiti primario et clarissimo, d. <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>suo aeternum colendo.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zürych</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
